msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bcc6c41739fb227d20908e5a31fe37fa838c48deb32746761ae98adc49a153d
#. default-sha256: 58e63d2822a5e7158ebe509613d3c8b0c0534be84e22554839bb7f07076d246e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94BEA963_2835_4F52_912F_6D6743EBAE65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We were kids, but we’d both kinda started to catch on—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to the situation with our "
"families, and to the bonds that land held on us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Éramos crianças, mas nós dois meio que começamos a entender–⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a situação com nossas "
"famílias e os laços que aquela terra tinha conosco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 557ec888eba3cb1a54ff7ee9377119d523f97f10779646fd289b3f808764c03a
#. default-sha256: cc0c7f1c2d5485fdfc1845dbbe2c10ba560fb470f9f630a8986414d7489ad8cf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B0E1009B_E596_43B6_8C25_F53242CA2929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although we didn’t know any of the details at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Embora não soubéssemos de nenhum dos detalhes na época."

#: scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c35d1bf223cfb8a592230bae9cac1ed931c54f886ae9f4f8645b822d9a8f54bb
#. default-sha256: 54346a5b2984ee789f2a7e351799c00fd6d72be9a2373f727bc5a0c16b81cf91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420E9C01_B49E_4D3D_9484_B9EB1E8426BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My grandpa owned all the land the city was built on, but he was a very conservative man. "
"⟪k:1⟫He didn’t try to spread his influence, instead opting to fortify what he already had."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Meu avô era dono de todas as terras em que a cidade foi construída, mas era um homem muito "
"conservador. ⟪k:1⟫Ele não tentou espalhar sua influência, em vez disso, optou por fortalecer o "
"que já tinha."

#: scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1753ab40dbe5f821d6e7a5e828bf95f1c74a8eca9e25bc5124e2631cccef3613
#. default-sha256: 62990fe99310283b13ec847efa9d84139b623032d092b4607fba69cc7a7e7fa5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_44E5E60F_619F_4783_9AF8_6D59FB70B4CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know exactly when it first started, but organizations were used to administrate "
"cities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não sei exatamente quando começou, mas organizações eram usadas para administrar cidades."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca70431dee746dbbcf02ec037a094b48cadbf45d8dbaff28d807f99e55c9b188
#. default-sha256: 09d42ab2a640dae5b591a2534f6184a33e6e1b026d8f7ce7de8b3aae3f7fe31e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FE03D2C2_CE9D_49A0_AD09_93D508BD862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And when we were kids, my dad was the capofamiglia, and my grandpa his consigliere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E quando éramos crianças, meu pai era o capofamiglia e meu avô seu consigliere."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ae704737281dd8ae52cd4275c4e49228df0d1e5f240f02c474aec668b53973c
#. default-sha256: 4f3ab3f3b60406fcbe4c8ed5a6c973d0a9f514709866603bfff29d1d6a8010b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE4155A7_D75E_47AA_BA2F_C5237A5D2575"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But just because he was an adviser didn’t mean he was powerless. ⟪k:1⟫While my dad made the "
"decisions, my grandpa was the only one allowed to fight him on them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas só porque ele era um conselheiro não significava que não tinha poder. ⟪k:1⟫Enquanto meu "
"pai tomava as decisões, meu avô era o único autorizado a discordar delas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56ee13b78dcea321154fe8f33c2e7ec460ee5e7dd963b072bc0089c7741bcc9a
#. default-sha256: 3d05454cd52cff6a824f9ff78ca323983eb6387667c984d3855fffdd8c636e59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56045517_5319_4499_BB6B_D42414E734FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your father was a capodecina that served under my dad; ⟪k:1⟫he wasn’t especially happy about "
"that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu pai era um capodecina que servia ao meu pai; ⟪k:1⟫ele não estava particularmente "
"contente com isso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba5be3b2eccb91a47b116c2664f33de7ba063f8c3956596e82ca4569759a3afc
#. default-sha256: 6de459e3b5a2d85392564f326e08d3d7bdb020334e70311db9257679fd5cd66a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E92A8C87_218D_41CE_9786_583BDA361FB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But parents’ quarreling doesn’t affect their kids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or at least, that’s what I "
"thought at the time, and what you probably thought too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas as disputas dos pais não afetam seus filhos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ou, pelo menos, é o que eu pensei "
"na época, e o que você provavelmente pensou também."

#: scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84ee954add433a90fb2a064776747b863b4f45fd03d03ac72c4f3cfb983b3f66
#. default-sha256: aad02b05cda7f07ca0233e43e9b3f75a12d1cbef842bb176eefb83729cfc18ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_28B62F9C_A22F_4061_8C74_AF06E01EF4AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was still a chance we could be caught in the crossfire, so my dad decided to send "
"me and my mom away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas ainda havia uma chance de sermos pegos no fogo cruzado, então meu pai decidiu mandar "
"minha mãe e eu embora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3baf15956ede59956a2e21d3e75b1732195b86335daab7a06fdb014549ab0fb7
#. default-sha256: 531825f512debbc332f65b14485e8a72c76bc67bdfdcce2d5e2924af60d2c938
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F203B666_9A02_4FA1_97BC_4021E9442EBC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Off the island and to the north were some more prosperous areas."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ao norte, fora da ilha, havia algumas áreas mais prósperas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70e07e07fdb77e9c0737d67cc2a5b62fb7ab4d0955ccefd15b3c71a67214fe94
#. default-sha256: a0396221993ab404c6c82ed2a6592f406a64e4fcdb1e69ca616f692d2de29dbd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFB90E92_858C_4A69_8A70_A1F053E3BA3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He thought that by sending us there, we could live our lives clean, regardless of where we "
"came from."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele achava que, enviando-nos para lá, poderíamos viver nossas vidas honestamente, "
"independentemente de onde viéssemos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09077d1e0f06b94dc5247cff8af7d65e43f5f8002d28cc69638b3e737020b9d0
#. default-sha256: 99ed452b1a41cf0daf2a9625d5788d45c730a051f7254d0d338004d90525e8bf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB5A0103_4072_4CE8_97DE_29C346E2241A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s no changing what’s in your blood, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não há como mudar o que está no seu sangue, no entanto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3c25701fe182ae9cc70b4048bb889b8fb0261028b17c8087ad4ca8bbbf139bc
#. default-sha256: 1043fe1f8ef795aaaa461f036e4a0fbe0b717dde5fb5994d8c2f5733abea98ce
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_65B10959_E51A_4BFE_BAD9_71004141E3EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You could have told me too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or were you planning on leaving without saying anything?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você poderia ter me contado também.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ou você estava pensando em ir sem dizer nada?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee828d818e78936356867af76b1189e407b7239e6ef7ef5932edf4835259fb2d
#. default-sha256: 2f07b930daeaed0af808b113177e7b648273f2dd5f94a4afaa9496e02f2c683e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_238D2C70_8B02_445E_A29F_79A27DE018DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No, it was just... ⟪k:1⟫all decided so quickly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não, só que... ⟪k:1⟫tudo foi decidido tão rápido."

#: scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51acf41e5300605785bd992bce213f2d38a8c1d53701581e8189c439568fcaf7
#. default-sha256: eb15043144bbff7a52eb075170238c8b4150345a8ddabab77f87c6b5e00f3eda
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_526F465D_F414_4B7B_BDFB_CBB6009BBC02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you sound so accepting?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que você parece tão conformada?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7f8ca6db48a35d92174b4e74cf665f368739d5307c9c150b9abe4ebd907a253
#. default-sha256: 9e9cb9640470e31adc78b0d5acba3b3513584efbbab1850beaa3aaa673efb5e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E46D378D_F8E2_4F01_9878_B209DD6FB66B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Adults have a lot to consider?⟪k:1⟫You bet they do! But you could at least let them know "
"you’re opposed to it, Maria! But no, your tail went straight between your legs as soon as you "
"were told."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os adultos têm muito a considerar? Pode apostar que eles têm! Mas você poderia pelo menos "
"deixar que eles saibam que você se opõe a isso, Maria! Mas não, botou o rabo entre as pernas "
"assim que lhe disseram."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD4238B2_DF1E_4F6E_8239_B8DCDE698AFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 560d9adc31f59ccc0c95dd2f12847fe85e1f07bde185b3aa51c5f317209a0d5a
#. default-sha256: 97116c258ed4b999aa996da7e3e7f41a9527d6b3f7d037c0449a2989beb3298e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD4238B2_DF1E_4F6E_8239_B8DCDE698AFF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You just gave up and accepted it straight away!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você simplesmente desistiu e aceitou imediatamente!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6ACE91E0_57E9_42AB_A176_501F27BA5E25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7fc024cc3c699406ee2f5e1c9aef1e01a669f170e381973ac33997c5ab475d1
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6ACE91E0_57E9_42AB_A176_501F27BA5E25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA349960_186A_4D99_B875_EEA811D839DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c3183cf0821cf1ab171b51ad4359b67e5b91d902f24b8d96ddf21cbe24010ed
#. default-sha256: 7d19ef584c65934613f5d572e8d1b624986b85c615c621ae105fd57725217e25
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA349960_186A_4D99_B875_EEA811D839DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I thought you were better than that!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pensei que fosse melhor do que isso!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B3F28C3_B933_491E_877B_A211002E3283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42ee7f6062b0ec838f86526f7588c0d45462daeaecdbf9aae2138717001f5c24
