"deixavam fazer o nosso lance."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98FB91E2_F439_41A4_B8A7_8B97EB96BFE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e671ed690b5dd9ea884a8b97178dff7d8d30b27d73d90b2a3b121357bd594314
