msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yeah, there was this one time we were playing and a huge storm rolled in, trapping us up "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, sim, houve uma vez que estávamos brincando e uma enorme tempestade veio, nos prendendo "
"lá em cima."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A08454AA_660C_4D48_896F_E734565DB339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
