msgid "⟪k:0⟫The wind wasn’t just howling—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was screaming bloody murder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O vento não estava apenas uivando—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫estava gritando por assassinato sanguinolento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E07DA6DF_8CAA_4E0E_8AC4_ED032E67AC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
