msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was blowing so hard I thought the house might fly away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I recall, you were "
"crying that night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Estava soprando tão forte que pensei que a casa fosse voar para longe.⟪k:1⟫ Pelo que me "
"lembro, você estava chorando naquela noite."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CE4A3EE0_25B3_4F1F_8B23_A9526C4A583C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
