msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t just the two of us who had made Casa Nostra our home base, though. ⟪k:1⟫There was "
"one more—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a stray, black dog."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, não fomos apenas nós dois que fizemos da Casa Nostra nossa base. ⟪k:1⟫Havia mais "
"um—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫um cão de rua preto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C60A5C6E_4397_4583_8C53_FDF14A32F11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0094a4b3c656cf71ba5570727244655dbb3f5c965f726f8761941dc42002dfff
